<title>USA: DBT Online stake held by Soros group.</title>
<headline>DBT Online stake held by Soros group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including George Soros said Friday it holds a 5.51 percent stake in DBT Online Inc or 499,053 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 175,000 common shares on May29 at $38 per share.</p>
<p>The shares were acquired for investment purposes, the group said.</p>
</text>
